# PCM-14B.3 — line-ending discipline (root fix for Windows autocrlf drift).
# The repo stores LF; deploys are produced with `git archive` from Windows
# where core.autocrlf=true would otherwise export CRLF (breaks Dockerfile,
# blob-identity checks). Force LF export for all text, binary for images.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.db binary
*.docx binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
